WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
WordPress and Beds24. A property availability and pricing demonstration by Giovinazzo José.

00:04.500 --> 00:11.500
La Maison des Oliviers: a demonstration holiday rental in Corsica, with a property description, photos and a nightly price.

00:11.500 --> 00:18.500
Choose arrival on 22 November 2026, departure on 24 November, and two adults. Search for availability.

00:18.500 --> 00:27.500
The connected Beds24 demonstration property returns an available stay: two nights, two adults, a total price of 300 euros.

00:27.500 --> 00:34.500
For 25–27 November, the property is unavailable. The page invites the visitor to choose different dates.

00:34.500 --> 00:41.500
The property page and search interface are available in French, Italian and English.

00:41.500 --> 00:47.500
The same experience adapts to mobile screens.

00:47.500 --> 00:54.000
Design and development by Giovinazzo José. Demonstration property: no reservation or payment is created. Silent demonstration.
